{"id":"design-browser-history","title":"Design Browser History","difficulty":"Medium","pattern":"Design","tags":["Array","Stack","Design","Doubly-Linked List"],"companies":{"google":1,"apple":2,"meta":1,"amazon":2,"microsoft":2},"kind":"design","class_name":"BrowserHistory","description":"Model the back and forward buttons of a single browser tab.\n\n- `BrowserHistory(homepage)` opens the tab on `homepage`.\n- `visit(url)` navigates to `url` from the current page. Any pages that were ahead in the forward history are discarded.\n- `back(steps)` moves back up to `steps` pages. If there are fewer than `steps` pages behind, you stop at the oldest page. Returns the current url afterwards.\n- `forward(steps)` moves forward up to `steps` pages, stopping at the newest page if there are fewer. Returns the current url afterwards.","examples":[{"input":"[\"BrowserHistory\",\"visit\",\"visit\",\"visit\",\"back\",\"back\",\"forward\",\"visit\",\"forward\",\"back\",\"back\"]\n[[\"home.com\"],[\"a.com\"],[\"b.com\"],[\"c.com\"],[1],[1],[1],[\"d.com\"],[2],[2],[7]]","output":"[null,null,null,null,\"b.com\",\"a.com\",\"b.com\",null,\"d.com\",\"a.com\",\"home.com\"]","explanation":"Visiting d.com from b.com throws away c.com, so forward(2) has nowhere to go and stays on d.com. back(7) is clamped at the homepage."},{"input":"[\"BrowserHistory\",\"back\",\"forward\",\"visit\",\"back\",\"forward\"]\n[[\"x\"],[3],[3],[\"y\"],[1],[5]]","output":"[null,\"x\",\"x\",null,\"x\",\"y\"]"}],"constraints":["1 <= homepage.length, url.length <= 20","1 <= steps <= 100","At most 5000 calls in total"],"hints":["Two stacks (back and forward) work: visit pushes onto back and clears forward. But clearing is O(size).","A single array with a `current` index makes back and forward simple index arithmetic clamped to the valid range.","To make visit O(1) too, keep an `end` index marking the last valid page instead of physically truncating the array; visit overwrites position current+1 and sets end to it."],"starter":"class BrowserHistory:\n    def __init__(self, homepage: str):\n        pass\n\n    def visit(self, url: str) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def back(self, steps: int) -> str:\n        pass\n\n    def forward(self, steps: int) -> str:\n        pass\n","compare":"exact","tests":[{"input":{"ops":[["BrowserHistory",["home.com"]],["visit",["a.com"]],["visit",["b.com"]],["visit",["c.com"]],["back",[1]],["back",[1]],["forward",[1]],["visit",["d.com"]],["forward",[2]],["back",[2]],["back",[7]]]},"output":[null,null,null,null,"b.com","a.com","b.com",null,"d.com","a.com","home.com"]},{"input":{"ops":[["BrowserHistory",["x"]],["back",[3]],["forward",[3]],["visit",["y"]],["back",[1]],["forward",[5]]]},"output":[null,"x","x",null,"x","y"]},{"input":{"ops":[["BrowserHistory",["h"]],["visit",["a"]],["visit",["b"]],["back",[2]],["visit",["c"]],["forward",[1]],["back",[1]],["forward",[1]],["visit",["d"]],["back",[100]],["forward",[100]]]},"output":[null,null,null,"h",null,"c","h","c",null,"h","d"]},{"input":{"ops":[["BrowserHistory",["h"]],["visit",["a"]],["visit",["b"]],["visit",["c"]],["back",[3]],["forward",[2]],["visit",["z"]],["forward",[1]],["back",[1]],["back",[1]],["back",[1]]]},"output":[null,null,null,null,"h","b",null,"z","b","a","h"]},{"input":{"ops":[["BrowserHistory",["home"]],["visit",["p1"]],["visit",["p2"]],["visit",["p3"]],["visit",["p4"]],["visit",["p5"]],["visit",["p6"]],["visit",["p7"]],["visit",["p8"]],["visit",["p9"]],["visit",["p10"]],["visit",["p11"]],["visit",["p12"]],["visit",["p13"]],["visit",["p14"]],["visit",["p15"]],["visit",["p16"]],["visit",["p17"]],["visit",["p18"]],["visit",["p19"]],["visit",["p20"]],["visit",["p21"]],["visit",["p22"]],["visit",["p23"]],["visit",["p24"]],["visit",["p25"]],["visit",["p26"]],["visit",["p27"]],["visit",["p28"]],["visit",["p29"]],["visit",["p30"]],["visit",["p31"]],["visit",["p32"]],["visit",["p33"]],["visit",["p34"]],["visit",["p35"]],["visit",["p36"]],["visit",["p37"]],["visit",["p38"]],["visit",["p39"]],["vi